    "decision": "Spread winners across suits when buying, and in play cash a winner in a new suit before running a long one.",
    "opponent": "Shown on the first win; opponents hold back their only stopper in your team's missing suit.",
    "rationale": "seed-rainbow-first (+8.0) shows that per-suit partial credit works where all-four thresholds swing. Compounding per new suit gives Rainbow a rare that pays about ×1.7 typically and ×2.07 at four suits, without seed-rainbow-x's all-or-nothing shape.",
